                                                "sense_id": "5c93eab8-6d44-3699-904c-f48116947b33",
                                                "text": "On being told, however, that the Norwegian barque Daphne was about to leave An-peng for Tamsui, I had my things taken on board, and we set sail a few hours later."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
